 "reading": "Mean satisfaction fell from 4.15 in 2024 to 4.07 in 2025 although it rose by about 0.1 point in every origin market: visitors from the Gulf, Asia and Europe, who score lower, grew from 25% to 44% of respondents, and with the 2024 mix the 2025 score would have been 4.25. This does not show that any site got worse or whose fault the fall is; it shows that the board is now surveying a different mix of visitors, and it rests on who answered the survey, not on all visitors.",
